            "span": "11:40 am",
            "h3": "Art and craft",
            "p": "Paint, clay, paper tearing, pasting. Aprons on. Something goes home in the bag most days."
          },
          {
            "span": "12:15 pm",
            "h3": "Story and goodbye",
            "p": "One story on the mat, then the goodbye song. Children are handed only to the adult on the pick-up card."
